  _glyph: 
  _subtitle: Chapter 2
  _description: '[[bff2dcff-df4c-46a2-a793-2f30f4a6a243|Dorothy Gale]] wakes up in
    the land of the Munchkins. The [[03edb354-6491-4fb1-b9db-e8a5191116d3|Good Witch
    of the North]] sends her to the Wizard and gives her the [[2e4de19b-3763-415b-8e68-19fefeeab4ee|Silver
    Shoes]].'
